  "description": "Roslyn source generator that emits strongly-typed Avalonia markup extensions for classes marked with [Theme]. The generator scans the compilation for every [Theme]-attributed class and produces one {theme:PropertyName} markup extension per public property, so XAML binds theme values directly without runtime code generation. Most users want the bundled AngelSix.ThemeEngine package (which contains this analyzer plus the runtime); install this standalone only if you ship your own runtime side.",
